        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So what brings sophisticated folks like yourselves way out here? You need to get above the Icefall? No worries! I totally got you covered!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Yeti_Explorer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zoot_POL_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1217874,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I got ropes and everything. Hey though, maybe you could do me a favor first? I'm looking for another Yeti. I have been, for my whole life.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Yeti_Explorer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zoot_POL_05.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1217874,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I've heard there were sightings out here, and I've seen tracks, but turns out, this Yeti's like totally elusive. Either that or it doesn't exist.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Yeti_Explorer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zoot_POL_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1217874,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC02_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Iceblight Elves know something though. They tease me every time I go out. If you could get them to talk, that'd be so awesome.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Yeti_Explorer_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_POL|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zoot_POL_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1217874,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "PL-FROZ-NPC02_Persona",
